'''Mr. Fred''' is a [[boss]] that can appear:
* {{dlc|nr}} In the {{s|Womb}} and the {{s|Utero}}.
* {{dlc+|r}} In the {{s|Womb}} and the {{s|Scarred Womb}}.{{dlc-}}
__TOC__

== Behavior ==
Mr. Fred stays stationary in the middle of a 1x2 or 2x1 room and performs the following attacks:
* Breaks the chain of 1 of the 4 {{e|Homunculus|text=Homunculi}} that accompany him at the beginning of the fight.
** Unlike other Homounculi, the ones spawned with Mr. Fred can not break free on their own and can only be unleashed by this attack.
* Shoots 4 large long-range blood projectiles in the cardinal directions. These tears leave [[Creep#Red Creep|Red Creep]] and will burst at the end of their range into a larger pool of Creep.
* Burrows underground briefly and pops back up in his original position, firing eight projectiles in all directions.
* Spawns a {{e|Fred}} on his position, which immediately burrows underground.
Mr. Fred deals a whole heart of contact damage.

