== Trivia ==
* Mr. Fred is the boss version of the {{e|Fred}}s.
* Mr. Fred resembles a large baby with a medical condition [[wikipedia:Harlequin-type ichthyosis|Harlequin Ichthyosis]]. He could, therefore, be a giant [[Harlequin Baby]].
* Mr. Fred may be the inspiration for [https://mewgenics.wiki.gg/wiki/Throbbing_King The Throbbing King's] design.
* {{dlc|na+}} Unlike other bosses, Mr. Fred disappears upon death instead of exploding into blood.
* {{dlc+|a+}} Similar to Delirium's room, if Mr. Fred spawns in {{s|The Void}}, his room will be seen in the map as a 1x1 room.{{dlc-}}
** That's why he can't be replaced by a [[harbinger]] with {{i|Book of Revelations}}
* Mr. Fred's boss art shows the ground around him to be grey, instead of a fleshy red.

